      "page": "page-1",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 640,
      "text": "STOREFRONT \u2014 desktop 1440.\nHome carries both shelves: equipment in graphite + volt, supplements in ember. Listing and product detail follow the same 4-up card grid."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-batch",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 640,
      "text": "Two product-detail templates, one system. SUPPLEMENT detail leads with batch / manufactured / best-before and a nutrition table."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-buyflow",
      "page": "page-2",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 700,
      "text": "BUY FLOW \u2014 cart \u2192 delivery \u2192 payment \u2192 confirmation, one step indicator across all screens. The stack discount is applied automatically; there is no coupon step."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-admin",
      "page": "page-3",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 640,
      "text": "ADMIN \u2014 the two tiles that matter for this business are low-stock SKUs and batches expiring within 90 days. Revenue chart is a single series, so no legend."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-mobile",
      "page": "page-3",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 640,
      "text": "MOBILE 390 \u2014 full scroll length, not a single viewport. No fake status bar: the real one renders on top. Every tappable element is at least 44px."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-system",
      "page": "page-4",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 640,
      "text": "Tokens and components every other artboard is built from. Anton for headings, Instrument Sans for everything else, 3px radius, no drop shadows."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-equipment",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": 4680,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 640,
      "text": "EQUIPMENT detail is the other half: a spec table (steel gauge, capacity, footprint, hole spacing), freight and crate info for a 138kg item, 0% instalments, assembly booking and a lifetime frame warranty \u2014 none of which a supplement page needs."
    }
  ],
